    "html": "<p>Four of the energy states for an atom are shown. Transition between any two states is possible.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the shortest wavelength of radiation that can be emitted from these four states?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{E_{4}-E_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{E_{4}}-\\frac{hc}{E_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{E_{4}-E_{3}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{E_{4}}-\\frac{hc}{E_{3}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
